#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:2
msgid "How to create reproducible builds"
msgstr "如何创建可复现构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:4
msgid ""
"Your documentation depends on a number of dependencies to be built. If your "
"docs don't have :term:`reproducible` builds, an update in a dependency can "
"break your builds when least expected, or make your docs look different from"
" your local version. This guide will help you to keep your builds working "
"over time, so that you can focus on content."
msgstr ""
"你的文档构建依赖若干依赖项。如果你的文档没有 :term:`可复现 <reproducible>` "
"构建，依赖更新可能在最意想不到的时候导致构建失败，或者让文档外观与本地版本不一致。本指南将帮助你让构建长期保持正常工作，以便你专注于内容。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:13
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "目录"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:16
msgid ""
"This page explains how to pin the versions that correctly build your "
"project. The versions used in this page are just for illustrative purpose. "
"They are not the latest nor the recommended versions. It is up to you to "
"find those versions."
msgstr "本页介绍如何固定能正确构建你项目的版本。本页使用的版本仅作说明用途，并非最新或推荐版本。请自行确定合适的版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:22
msgid "Define OS and tool versions in the config file"
msgstr "在配置文件中定义操作系统与工具版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:24
msgid ""
"We recommend defining the explicit version of the OS and tool versions used "
"to build your documentation using the ``.readthedocs.yaml``. This file "
"*provides you per version settings*, and *those settings live in your Git "
"repository*."
msgstr ""
"我们建议使用 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` "
"显式定义用于构建文档的操作系统版本与工具版本。该文件*为每个版本提供独立设置*，且*这些设置位于你的 Git 仓库中*。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:29
msgid ""
"This allows you to validate changes using :doc:`pull requests </pull-"
"requests>`, and ensures that all your versions can be rebuilt from a "
"reproducible configuration."
msgstr "这让你能通过 :doc:`Pull Requests </pull-requests>` 验证变更，并确保所有版本都能从可复现的配置中重新构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:33
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:54
msgid ".readthedocs.yaml"
msgstr ".readthedocs.yaml"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:47
msgid "Use a requirements file for Python dependencies"
msgstr "使用 requirements 文件管理 Python 依赖"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:49
msgid ""
"We recommend using a Pip :ref:`requirements file <pip:requirements-file-"
"format>` or Conda :ref:`environment file <config-file/v2:conda.environment>`"
" to :term:`pin <pinning>` Python dependencies. This ensures that top-level "
"dependencies and extensions don't change."
msgstr ""
"我们建议使用 Pip :ref:`requirements 文件 <pip:requirements-file-format>` 或 Conda "
":ref:`环境文件 <config-file/v2:conda.environment>` 来 :term:`固定 <pinning>` Python"
" 依赖。这能确保顶层依赖与扩展保持不变。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:52
msgid "A configuration file with explicit dependencies looks like this:"
msgstr "包含显式依赖的配置文件如下所示："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:63
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:95
msgid "docs/requirements.txt"
msgstr "docs/requirements.txt"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:73
msgid ""
"Remember to update your docs' dependencies from time to time to get new "
"improvements and fixes. It also makes it easy to manage in case a version "
"reaches its end of support date."
msgstr "请定期更新文档的依赖以获取新改进和修复。这也能让你在某个版本达到生命周期结束时更容易管理。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:77
msgid "Pin your transitive dependencies"
msgstr "固定你的传递依赖"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:79
msgid ""
"Once you have :term:`pinned <pinning>` your own dependencies, the next "
"things to worry about are the dependencies of your dependencies. These are "
"called *transitive dependencies*, and they can upgrade without warning if "
"you do not pin these packages as well."
msgstr ""
"一旦你 :term:`固定 <pinning>` "
"了自己的直接依赖，接下来要关注的是依赖的依赖。这些被称为*传递依赖*，如果你不固定这些包，它们可能会在不知情的情况下升级。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:84
msgid ""
"We recommend `pip-tools`_ to help address this problem. It allows you to "
"specify a ``requirements.in`` file with your top-level dependencies, and it "
"generates a ``requirements.txt`` file with the full set of transitive "
"dependencies pinned."
msgstr ""
"我们推荐使用 `pip-tools`_ 来解决此问题。它允许你在 ``requirements.in`` "
"文件中指定顶层依赖，并生成一个包含完整传递依赖并已固定版本的 ``requirements.txt`` 文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/reproducible-builds.rst:90
msgid "docs/requirements.in"
msgstr "docs/requirements.in"

